{
    "word": "roadside",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "aa05f425-d986-3316-a9d9-84bf6fcfd1eb",
                "word": "roadside",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3099a534-7e48-3895-bd17-4366737d472a",
                        "entry_id": "aa05f425-d986-3316-a9d9-84bf6fcfd1eb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Located beside a road (or railway)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce864e33-11db-4198-983b-797e4fd97a44",
                                "sense_id": "3099a534-7e48-3895-bd17-4366737d472a",
                                "text": "The roadside stand did a good business just selling products to people who merely wanted directions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "37e7f2ee-d3b2-41e7-935f-7a64d29c3b02",
                                "sense_id": "3099a534-7e48-3895-bd17-4366737d472a",
                                "text": "I was rather impressed with the neat and tidy appearance of these roadside stations, many of which had their name boards painted in the blue and white colours of the Scottish Region."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "606e3fe3-fbf4-438c-87dd-2bb1cce4d41b",
                                "sense_id": "3099a534-7e48-3895-bd17-4366737d472a",
                                "text": "The roadside section of the tramway is limited to 12 m.p.h., except over the oblique road crossings, where speed is restricted to 4 m.p.h., with a compulsory stop immediately before."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ad48508-8b50-4d23-9c06-8ff94784bd6d",
                                "sense_id": "3099a534-7e48-3895-bd17-4366737d472a",
                                "text": "David Cameron has said the government will \"look carefully\" at the use of heavily armoured vehicles after three British soldiers were killed in Afghanistan by a roadside bomb while travelling in a Mastiff troop carrier."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "f8b3907d-4029-3afd-bba9-d5088116da20",
                "word": "roadside",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2e263396-a215-4bb2-b9ff-0fbe4eadff41",
                        "entry_id": "f8b3907d-4029-3afd-bba9-d5088116da20",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "roadsides"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "98b5f59a-39b7-31e9-8aeb-10f84a60ef73",
                        "entry_id": "f8b3907d-4029-3afd-bba9-d5088116da20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The area on either side of a road."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "54742747-e17c-417f-bb0a-072b473851ef",
                                "sense_id": "98b5f59a-39b7-31e9-8aeb-10f84a60ef73",
                                "text": "I pulled over to the roadside to check the map."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "209011d0-6e6a-4918-887f-ca0d99a92955",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8b3907d-4029-3afd-bba9-d5088116da20",
                        "source_sense_id": "98b5f59a-39b7-31e9-8aeb-10f84a60ef73",
                        "source_sense_description": "area on either side of a road",
                        "target_lang_word": "stoeprand",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "stoeprand",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4281db16-3963-382d-818e-0f22c6649f6c",
                                        "entry_id": "b58c1cfd-a5ec-3160-9507-96083aecdfb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een element dat de scheiding verzorgt tussen een rijbaan en het meestal hoger gelegen trottoir"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83a689f9-7d76-48f8-accb-ece574de4e02",
                                                "sense_id": "4281db16-3963-382d-818e-0f22c6649f6c",
                                                "text": "Deze week vond ik een sticker op mijn autoruit. „Niet zo parkeren, maar zo”, stond er in koeienletters, met daarbij twee grafische afbeeldingen van hoe een auto wel en niet in een parkeervak hoort te staan. Ik begreep niet wat ik verkeerd had gedaan, maar vermoedde dat het misschien te maken had met de afstand tussen mijn auto en de stoeprand. Die was - ik ben het uit woede gaan opmeten - precies 18,5 centimeter. Niet erg strak ingeparkeerd inderdaad, maar iedereen weet hoe moeilijk dat is met zo’n lange Volvo-station. Bovendien stond hij aan de straatkant precies op de streep, dus wat was het probleem?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dd7e84a5-b8ab-4ab5-9ec5-d3f25878763e",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8b3907d-4029-3afd-bba9-d5088116da20",
                        "source_sense_id": "98b5f59a-39b7-31e9-8aeb-10f84a60ef73",
                        "source_sense_description": "area on either side of a road",
                        "target_lang_word": "berm",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "berm",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e2c5c1b-fe2a-32d7-9298-f7460f08a85c",
                                        "entry_id": "427eac75-8e41-3d93-b41b-8ae1988f8db0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "de onverharde strook aan de kant van een weg of spoorweg"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f62bfc0c-17ed-48cf-a175-b6e4c9061762",
                                                "sense_id": "2e2c5c1b-fe2a-32d7-9298-f7460f08a85c",
                                                "text": "Na de slippartij kwam de vrachtauto in de berm terecht."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39ed0f4a-c986-47d8-9fc5-d9388571dd14",
                                                "sense_id": "2e2c5c1b-fe2a-32d7-9298-f7460f08a85c",
                                                "text": "Het was al donker toen ik een onverharde weg passeerde waar een aantal eenpersoonstenten in de berm stonden. Iedereen sliep al. Helaas paste mijn tent er niet meer bij en dus zocht ik in de bocht van de weg een vlak plekje op."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f4897425-e583-4bc6-b08b-bf3cc473d8d4",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8b3907d-4029-3afd-bba9-d5088116da20",
                        "source_sense_id": "98b5f59a-39b7-31e9-8aeb-10f84a60ef73",
                        "source_sense_description": "area on either side of a road",
                        "target_lang_word": "Straßenrand",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Straßenrand",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea948ca1-ae3a-36b4-bc03-41ce643bd2b7",
                                        "entry_id": "0c10f6d8-d42a-3364-81f6-a49a45e8ee95",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "seitliche Grenze einer Straße"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbeb9af6-6282-45de-aec1-d2e957dbb2c3",
                                                "sense_id": "ea948ca1-ae3a-36b4-bc03-41ce643bd2b7",
                                                "text": "„Am Straßenrand standen ein paar hochbetagte, zerschundene Autos, und hin und wieder durchkreuzte ein israelisches Militärfahrzeug den Ort, von vielen undurchdringlichen Blicken begleitet.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e99164a7-f3e9-4f9d-8725-c1c83f53a2e1",
                                                "sense_id": "ea948ca1-ae3a-36b4-bc03-41ce643bd2b7",
                                                "text": "„Ich zwang mich, meinen Tank auffüllen zu lassen, und befahl mir, anzuhalten und einem alten Schwarzen, der schwerfüßig am Straßenrand entlangtrottete, eine Mitfahrt anzubieten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff31203b-e290-4349-a150-8d6bb0849fe9",
                                                "sense_id": "ea948ca1-ae3a-36b4-bc03-41ce643bd2b7",
                                                "text": "„Da sah ich auf einmal zwei am Straßenrande sitzen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48effe19-4112-4b20-8a71-3b322d096a32",
                                                "sense_id": "ea948ca1-ae3a-36b4-bc03-41ce643bd2b7",
                                                "text": "„Er dirigierte Pegasus an den Straßenrand und zeigte mir dann, wie die Laterne, die unter dem Oberlicht hing, anzuzünden war.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5621c5e-0620-418f-890d-82e697b72416",
                                                "sense_id": "ea948ca1-ae3a-36b4-bc03-41ce643bd2b7",
                                                "text": "„Sie hatten seine Leiche am Straßenrand gefunden, den Bauch aufgedunsen von rohem Getreide, das der Verzweifelte kurz vor dem Tod in sich hineingestopft hatte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
